Test 5: Check grounding

Ask a question about a detail not contained in the uploaded document.

Verify whether the application appropriately handles missing information rather than confidently inventing an answer.

Test 6: Inspect logs

If an operation fails, inspect both the frontend and backend terminals.

A successful Gemini API call alone does not prove that document upload, retrieval, and response generation are all working correctly.

